/ Claudy installable (redesign, Michael 2026-10-29) : le manifeste, l'icône de
  l'écran d'accueil et, en production, le service worker, que
  `utils/pwa.js` enregistre en lisant la balise `claudy-service-worker`.
link(rel="manifest" href=pwa_manifest_path)
meta(name="theme-color" content=PwaController::BACKGROUND_COLOR)
meta(name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes")
meta(name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes")
meta(name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Claudy")
meta(name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default")
link(rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png")
- if pwa_service_worker?
  meta(name="claudy-service-worker" content="/service-worker.js")
